    "narration": [
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "shotId": "s1",
        "text": "You shipped something. Now you need a video about it."
      },
      {
        "id": "n2",
        "shotId": "s2",
        "text": "Developers already produce a perfect record of what their software does — a terminal session."
      },
      {
        "id": "n3",
        "shotId": "s3",
        "text": "LaunchReel reads that session and builds the video around what was actually demonstrated."
      },
      {
        "id": "n4",
        "shotId": "s4",
        "text": "One command. It plans the shots, writes the narration, picks the music, and renders the timeline."
      },
      {
        "id": "n5",
        "shotId": "s5",
        "text": "A report shows every step — eight shots, two attempts, eight narration lines measured against their targets."
      },
      {
        "id": "n6",
        "shotId": "s6",
        "text": "The genuinely hard part is the music. You cannot tell a generator where to put the beat."
      },
      {
        "id": "n7",
        "shotId": "s7",
        "text": "So we ask for several candidates, measure every one, and pick the track whose beats already land near the cuts."
      },
      {
        "id": "n8",
        "shotId": "s8",
        "text": "Narration is measured the same way. Lines that overrun stretch the shot; lines that can't are sent back for a rewrite."
      },
      {
        "id": "n9",
        "shotId": "s9",
        "text": "Then we snap the hit points to the beats we actually found."
      },
      {
        "id": "n10",
        "shotId": "s10",
        "text": "The result is a real timeline — thirty-five seconds, marked at every cut."
      },
      {
        "id": "n11",
        "shotId": "s11",
        "text": "And a real mp4 — h264, 1920 by 1080."
      },
      {
        "id": "n12",
        "shotId": "s12",
        "text": "Seventy-three tests gate every change."
      },
      {
        "id": "n13",
        "shotId": "s13",
        "text": "What you get is two files. The mp4. And the project."
      },
      {
        "id": "n14",
        "shotId": "s14",
        "text": "The Reel itself is just JSON — every shot, every line, fully inspectable."
      },
      {
        "id": "n15",
        "shotId": "s15",
        "text": "The OTIO file carries marked ranges where the cuts live on the beat."
      },
      {
        "id": "n16",
        "shotId": "s16",
        "text": "It opens in any real editor — Final Cut, Premiere, Resolve."
      },
      {
        "id": "n17",
        "shotId": "s17",
        "text": "Try it. One command. No API key. No network. No Python. MIT."
      }
    ],
